GhostSpiral v10.5 - Fully-wired BTC->XMR Mixer Core
=====================================================
!! RESEARCH / RED-TEAM TOOL !!
Never use on main-net coins you do not own.

End-to-end pipeline:
  Stage 0: Validate inputs, Tor, RPC sync
  Stage 1: JoinMarket receive (optional BTC tumble; runs JoinMarket's own
           tumbler.py, which this repo neither ships nor installs)
  Stage 2: ThorChain BTC->XMR swap QUOTES ONLY. This fetches deposit
           addresses and memos and prints them; it does NOT send BTC and
           cannot. The operator makes the deposit by hand, and the run waits
           for the XMR to arrive. The header said "swap", which reads as
           something this executes.
  Stage 3: Build wallets & DAG mixing graph
  Stage 4: Build unsigned TX plan with fee-aware amounts
  Stage 5: Auto-sign + broadcast the mixing rounds, then EXIT: with
           --exit-to <address> the mixed funds are withdrawn off this wallet,
           ONE TRANSACTION PER OUTPUT. Without it nothing is withdrawn and the
           run says so -- this step used to be a price valuation that moved no
           money while the pipeline reported completion.

